<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman ups Continental.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman ups Continental.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said on Thursday it had raised its price target and earnings per share estimates for German tyre maker Continental AG after the company's strong earnings on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The brokerage upped its 12-month price target to 37 marks from 32 marks and its 1997 earnings per share estimate to 3.0 marks from 2.7 marks.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
